WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.490
Two identical twins stand at the
bottom of the same staircase.

2
00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:06.520
One sprints to the top.

3
00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:09.900
The other walks up
slowly, a step at a time.

4
00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:13.870
The runner gets there first;
the walker takes longer.

5
00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:16.590
Both end up on the same top step.

6
00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:18.360
Who has done more work?

7
00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:20.530
And who is more powerful?

8
00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:23.480
In this mission, you'll
define power precisely,

9
00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:26.790
and meet the unit it is
measured in, the watt.

10
00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:30.310
Then you'll time a 60 kg
student climbing stairs,

11
00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:32.250
and calculate their power.

12
00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:35.770
Your mission: decide
which twin does more work,

13
00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:37.560
and which is more powerful.
